  "_comment": "A figure of eight on two levels through the hills: up round the big hill on a banked climb, then over the humpback high bridge, its crest twenty metres above the start road, down a banked descent past sliding platforms and bumper blocks, an off-camber run to the creek, a glide over it and back under the bridge. A hill trail with two jumps cuts inside the big hill, from lap 2 a twin bridge rises level with the high one, and the creek floods its banks on the last lap.",
